    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You sweep a hand across your face. A clean breath of wind drives a channel through the hanging smoke.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Maneuver</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Up to three connected visible squares within 3 squares containing ordinary smoke or fog.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Utility / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Disperse ordinary smoke or fog in the chosen squares until the end of your next turn.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/clear-the-smoke.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/clear-the-smoke.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
